{"title":"[OpenAI] 最近的 Codex 是不是越来越容易失焦：没规划、丢上下文，越改越偏？","link":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1260636#reply2","date":1795876654000,"content":"\n\t<p>最近的 codex 经常出现这种情况，是吗？</p>\n<ol>\n<li>没有整体规划</li>\n<li>上下文似乎丢失或者失焦</li>\n<li>越改越错(越纠偏越失去任务目标)</li>\n</ol>\n<p><img alt=\"codex online\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/media/f5fe1a339fb8fd1e11eea9ef87c8e6b13294f267146e03ed23fe5b57fa96db3c.png\" /></p>\n\n\t","author":"enrolls","siteTitle":"V2EX","siteHash":"3e860ec03da35d802da530ce9241dfb35d861748393acba05f4337a7da1627c0","entryHash":"3c6303456e671cbfbd2b001768a95f0ac58ec570973a21e872f94cb033a6fb82","category":"IT 科技"}